      "confidence": "medium",
      "note": "Listed as a schemaLimit, but the patterns were English ('cinc past dues'), so I replaced them with the no-schema minute system: hours carry the article ('la una', 'les dues'), patterns '{h} en punt', '{h} i cinc', '{h} i quart', '{h} i mitja', '{next_h} menys quart' etc. -> 'la una en punt', 'les dues i quart', 'les tres menys quart'. This is standard Valencian/Balearic and understood everywhere; the Central-Catalan bell system ('un quart de quatre') still needs schema support, as the audit says. Overwrite freely if a schema change lands."
